## 5. Quick Final Risk Check

These are high-risk issues that often weaken IA submissions.

| Risk | Why It Is Serious | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| no clear client/user | problem feels invented | identify client/user and needs |
| vague problem | criteria become weak | describe current system and specific issues |
| vague success criteria | cannot test/evaluate | rewrite as measurable criteria |
| design does not match product | planning looks weak | update/explain design changes |
| development is only screenshots | no technical explanation | add code snippets and explanations |
| testing only valid data | weak robustness | add invalid/boundary tests |
| no expected results | testing unclear | write expected vs actual |
| no evaluation against criteria | unsupported conclusion | evaluate each criterion |
| no limitations | unrealistic | add honest specific limitations |
| no evidence | claims unsupported | add screenshots, tests, feedback |

