### General Design

| Check | Done? |
|---|---|
| Design was planned before or during development, not only after completion. |  |
| Design links to success criteria. |  |
| Design explains how the user will complete key tasks. |  |
| Design decisions are justified. |  |
| Major design changes are explained. |  |

