| Check | Done? |
|---|---|
| Main screens/pages are planned. |  |
| Wireframes or screen sketches are included where useful. |  |
| Navigation between screens/pages is clear. |  |
| Buttons, menus, and form fields are labelled clearly. |  |
| Error messages or feedback messages are planned. |  |

### Data and Processing

| Check | Done? |
|---|---|
| Inputs and outputs are identified. |  |
| Data structures or database/file structure are planned. |  |
| Important fields and data types are listed. |  |
| Storage and retrieval are explained if used. |  |
| Important algorithms are planned with pseudocode or flowcharts. |  |
| Search/filter/sort/calculation logic is explained where relevant. |  |

### Validation and Testing Plan

| Check | Done? |
|---|---|
| Required field validation is planned. |  |
| Range checks are planned where relevant. |  |
| Format checks are planned where relevant. |  |
| Invalid input responses are planned. |  |
| Each success criterion has at least one possible test idea. |  |

