## 12. Academic Integrity Checklist

| Check | Done? |
|---|---|
| The product is the student's own work. |  |
| External code/libraries/resources are acknowledged. |  |
| The student understands all submitted code. |  |
| Tutorial code is not submitted as original work. |  |
| AI or online assistance is used only according to school rules. |  |
| Client feedback and test evidence are real, not fabricated. |  |
| Images/screenshots do not expose private data without permission. |  |
| Full code or appendix material matches the product described. |  |

::: warning Academic Integrity Reminder
Students should follow official school and IB guidance. If unsure, ask the teacher before using external code, AI tools, libraries, or templates.
:::

