## 17. Last 24-hour Checklist

Before final submission:

```text
open the final product and check it runs
check screenshots match final product
check success criteria numbering is consistent
check test numbers and figure numbers
check all links/references work
check private data is removed
check appendix/code is included if required
check file name and format match instructions
export final PDF/document if required
keep backup copy
```

### Do Not Do This at the Last Minute

```text
rewrite success criteria completely
add many new features without testing
change code without retesting
delete evidence
insert screenshots without explanation
claim untested features are complete
```

